### Summary

**Root cause of production bugs:** Every test is a "fire-and-forget" call. The suite proves methods don't throw — it proves nothing about correctness. A mutation (e.g., `ApplyBulkDiscount` multiplying instead of discounting, `RemoveProduct` becoming a no-op) would still pass all tests. Fix the assertions and you'll catch real regressions.
